      "title": "&lsquo;AirBnb reviews for Castle Dracula&rsquo;. A halloween books cartoon for The Guardian from a while back.",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/66692207b56922347ccfa24445c99cdb/db133398ff3dc1ff-2b/s640x960/dffc8aa22feb6892964d4a1321b5fe79ad5f96bf.jpg\" data-orig-height=\"959\" data-orig-width=\"1500\" alt=\"Title: AirBnb reviews for Castle Dracula &#10;&#10;1.&#10;Old-world charm! &#10;As the host says: 'the walls of my castle are broken. The shadows are many, and the wind breathes cold through the broken battlements&quot; but we were enchanted. Thanks count! &#10;&#10;2.&#10;Bring earplugs! &#10;I was kept awake by the constant howling of wolves. Host was unsympathetic, just said &quot;The children of the night. What music they make!&quot; And crawled out of the window.&#10;&#10;3.&#10;Don't bother! &#10;My wife was bitten by something in the night and has become an undead monstrosity With wanton desires and an unquenchable thirst for human blood. Also, terrible wi-fi.&#10;\" srcset=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/66692207b56922347ccfa24445c99cdb/db133398ff3dc1ff-2b/s75x75_c1/27257c2aaa0f9b343b6129c2aca0dbfeb5282dcb.jpg 75w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/66692207b56922347ccfa24445c99cdb/db133398ff3dc1ff-2b/s100x200/c97cf17a37a9782efffd801745e3e8fb82a574f7.jpg 100w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/66692207b56922347ccfa24445c99cdb/db133398ff3dc1ff-2b/s250x400/ed0e810c1d61bb6109493bb05bf8e72680253411.jpg 250w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/66692207b56922347ccfa24445c99cdb/db133398ff3dc1ff-2b/s400x600/20412087c2f057899b709ccfc1425828ff25775b.jpg 400w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/66692207b56922347ccfa24445c99cdb/db133398ff3dc1ff-2b/s500x750/21c308e88300d1c4ef9d1c6afd8189865229a166.jpg 500w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/66692207b56922347ccfa24445c99cdb/db133398ff3dc1ff-2b/s540x810/1cf8c3806b77eb4c3661d9424dc6920d37280390.jpg 540w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/66692207b56922347ccfa24445c99cdb/db133398ff3dc1ff-2b/s640x960/dffc8aa22feb6892964d4a1321b5fe79ad5f96bf.jpg 640w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/66692207b56922347ccfa24445c99cdb/db133398ff3dc1ff-2b/s1280x1920/f8