      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/a1db6ec9d58dc6efc62c4615db5fa4cb/3322501b752ddac7-20/s640x960/4a4ea2318954a261791a75be5fd98609e3156550.jpg\" data-orig-height=\"824\" data-orig-width=\"1500\" alt=\"Title: The extreme reader's hyper-optimised day.  3.15 am The reader sits in an Ice bath  Other elements are labelled: Intravenous breakfast  Non-fiction  Fiction  Books podcast  Poetry playlist   11.05 am  The reader runs on a Treadmill  Other elements are labelled: Snack (single prune) Dictating goodreads reviews  Auto-scrolling e-book  Audiobook at 6x speed   4.25 pm  The reader is in a Hyperbaric chamber  Other elements are labelled: AI-summarised classic  Multiple online book clubs  Evening meal-pouch  Achievement spreadsheet\" srcset=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/a1db6ec9d58dc6efc62c4615db5fa4cb/3322501b752ddac7-20/s75x75_c1/65bd3395d8eb559042af01ef4fff02ee576d1a7c.jpg 75w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/a1db6ec9d58dc6efc62c4615db5fa4cb/3322501b752ddac7-20/s100x200/86059a4e2391d12dbb6c7833b3cf961ea3b9cc64.jpg 100w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/a1db6ec9d58dc6efc62c4615db5fa4cb/3322501b752ddac7-20/s250x400/af80a99af19ccc905c5ea10be292fccd9bbfa3b6.jpg 250w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/a1db6ec9d58dc6efc62c4615db5fa4cb/3322501b752ddac7-20/s400x600/79b0e4354311879c763ef286443f51df01eea2f1.jpg 400w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/a1db6ec9d58dc6efc62c4615db5fa4cb/3322501b752ddac7-20/s500x750/c1356b67a1ea3e829b849c27b192d9670b71d51e.jpg 500w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/a1db6ec9d58dc6efc62c4615db5fa4cb/3322501b752ddac7-20/s540x810/84fc89e89f9264bcfa13b00a7d26d114e5e09d03.jpg 540w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/a1db6ec9d58dc6efc62c4615db5fa4cb/3322501b752ddac7-20/s640x960/4a4ea2318954a261791a75be5fd98609e3156550.jpg 640w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/a1db6ec9d58dc6efc62c4615db5fa4cb/3322501b752ddac7-20/s1280x1920/dbb0106b08f8d5b5f0e949b14e377139a7a29ab8.jpg 1280w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/a1db6ec9d58dc6efc62c4615db5fa4cb/3322501b752ddac7-20/s2048x3072/48